After reuniting with Gwen Stacy, Brooklyn’s full-time, friendly neighborhood Spider-Man is catapulted across the Multiverse, where
he encounters the Spider Society, a team of Spider-People charged with protecting the Multiverse's very existence.

4
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:30,000
