11
01:01:36,000 --> 01:01:42,000
Spider-Man: Beyond the Spider-Verse is an upcoming American animated superhero film
based on Marvel Comics featuring the character Miles Morales / Spider-Man.

12
01:07:12,000 --> 01:07:18,000
Directed by Bob Persichetti and Justin K.

13
01:12:48,000 --> 01:12:54,000
Thompson from a screenplay by the writing team of Phil Lord and Christopher Miller alongside David Callaham, it is the direct
sequel to Spider-Man: Across the Spider-Verse (2023) and the final installment in the Spider-Verse trilogy.

14
01:18:24,000 --> 01:18:30,000
Shameik Moore stars as the voice of Miles, alongside Hailee Steinfeld, Jason
Schwartzman, Karan Soni, Daniel Kaluuya, and Nicolas Cage.

15
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
The film continues from the cliffhanger ending of Across the Spider-Verse, with
Miles trapped in an alternate universe trying to save his family.

16
01:29:36,000 --> 01:29:42,000
It is produced by Columbia Pictures and Sony Pictures Animation,
and is to be distributed by Sony Pictures Releasing.

17
01:35:12,000 --> 01:35:18,000
Sony began developing a sequel to Spider-Man: Into the Spider-Verse before that film's release in 2018,
and eventually decided to split it into two films, which was revealed in December 2021.

18
01:40:48,000 --> 01:40:54,000
The third film was titled in April 2022 and given a March 2024 release date, while early work
coincided with the production of Across the Spider-Verse before that film was prioritized.

19
01:46:24,000 --> 01:46:30,000
The script and animation of Beyond the Spider-Verse underwent significant changes before
the 2023 SAG-AFTRA strike delayed production and its release date in July.

20
01:52:00,000 --> 01:52:06,000
After the second film's release and the end of the
strike, work resumed in December.

21
01:57:36,000 --> 01:57:42,000
The writers and directors were revealed a year later, and a
new release date was announced in March 2025.

22
02:03:12,000 --> 02:03:18,000
Spider-Man: Beyond the Spider-Verse is scheduled to be
released in the United States on June 18, 2027.

23
02:08:48,000 --> 02:08:54,000
The film explores themes of new york city, hero,
sacrifice, secret identity, superhero.

24
02:14:24,000 --> 02:14:30,000
The tone is thought_provoking.
